think I HAD SPENT THE WHOLE SESSION ONE LANE OVER FROM MY OWN. Twelve pieces landed across the proving harness, every one of them real and compounding, and the incense card's three named items -- VERY HIGH Lindy, VERY HIGH crux -- stood untouched. A faster harness is leverage on building rather than building, and a measure-fix-measure loop is hard to leave precisely because it keeps paying.
