obs DIMEROLL HAS NOT BEGUN: five files, none receipt-named, for the product owing half the falsifier. And of the eight acceptance cases, NONE carries its own witness -- the two rostered guards hold the falsifier's code half and the page's ceiling declarations, which is real work and a different job from proving a case.
obs THE REVISION TOOK NO RULING AND MOVED NO REGISTER. The four borrowed derivations and the identifier enumeration stay parked at Keaton's word because both change what the product admits. Seventeen sentences were added and the page's register held at 58 exactly, composite 88 both ways -- which is what an additive revision should do.
